OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for 650 homes as part of new
OL,4,Agarden village
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been submitted for a
OL,7,F650-home neighbourhood as part of a new
OL,8,Fgarden village.
OL,10,FTiviot Way Investments Ltd has applied
OL,11,Fto Darlington Borough Council for
OL,12,Fpermission to build on land at
OL,13,FBishopton Lane in Darlington, forming
OL,14,Fpart of Skerningham Garden Village.
OL,16,FCouncil documents show this phase of
OL,17,Fdevelopment would include 130
OL,18,Faffordable homes, residential
OL,19,Faccommodation for the elderly and open
OL,20,Fspaces.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
